    {
      "id": "claim_3648ae081c90483fb5a9fdf570de48fc",
      "statement": "parse_store is the only module that knows the on-disk layout of a parsed_input/, and it writes and reads the markdown as UTF-8 bytes rather than through universal-newline decoding, appending no trailing newline, because that exact string is what the deterministic metrics are computed on.",
